    "# Holographic MoLE — Mixture of LoRA Experts\n",
    "\n",
    "**Template notebook** — Replace with your own graph/data, adjust shard count, train LoRAs, build router + aggregator.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Context (128k-1M tokens)\n",
    "       │\n",
    "       ▼\n",
    "Semantic Fragmenter (BGE clustering) → N shards\n",
    "       │\n",
    "       ├─► Shard 0 (LoRA r=16) ──►\n",
    "       ├─► Shard 1 (LoRA r=16) ──►  Holographic Router (cosine sim)\n",
    "       ├─► ...          ──►       │\n",
    "       └─► Shard N (LoRA r=16) ──►▼\n",
    "                          Aggregator (cross-attention)\n",
    "                                   │\n",
    "                                   ▼\n",
    "                          Synthesized Output\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Phase 0: Prerequisites\n",
    "\n",
    "- Base model: `Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-3B` (or your choice)\n",
    "- Embedding model: `nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5` (via Ollama)\n",
    "- Data: JSONL files in `./data/shards/shard_{0..N-1}.jsonl`\n",
    "- GPU: ≥8 GB VRAM (QLoRA 4-bit fits 3B in ~6 GB)\n",
    "\n",
    "Run `00_setup_validation.ipynb` first to verify environment."
   ]
